{center}{arialbld}CHART OF USE FOR THE LEVEL EDITOR{arial}


{arialbld}a) EDITOR:{arial} - The game level editor is composed of a random map generator with adjustable factors offering billions of combinations, associated to a tool for building bases allowing to predefine camps manually.

{arialbld}b) SERVER:{arial} - The system provides a game level server allowing users to share games levels eventually developed by themselves. On this purpose the game levels developed by users need to be saved on Tactical Soft server. This requires an Internet connection.

{arialbld}c) SHARING:{arial} Users are invited to share the game levels they have created by submitting their levels from the editor to the server maintained by Tactical Soft. Users may also place ratings on levels offered on the server. This also requires an Internet connection.

{arialbld}d) EXCHANGES:{arial} - Game levels exchanges are allowed only through Tactical Soft server. Tactical Soft intend to preserve the quality of game levels offered to the audience. Publishing or distributing game levels for A.R.S.E.N.A.L Extended Power is reserved to Tactical Soft.

{arialbld}e) PROPERTY:{arial} - User has the right to use the game within the scope defined by license but any files or data composing the game recorded on the user's computer remain at any time the property of Tactical Soft. Therefore Tactical Soft may integrate freely in its products any levels developed by users.

{arialbld}f) GOOD TASTE:{arial} - Names given by users within the editor to cities or names given to game levels may not be offending to anyone and they may not contain any rude, sexual, religious or political terms or references.

{arialbld}g) SUSPENSION:{arial} - Tactical Soft reserves itself the right to suspend temporary or indefinitely the use of the editor to anyone, at any time and without prior notice.

{arialbld}h) RISK:{arial} - The EDITOR is delivered "AS IT IS" and the use of it is at your own risk, therefore Tactical Soft is NOT liable for any damage resulting of the use of this software.

{arialbld}i) MOTTO:{arial} - Tactical Soft disapprove the design of games with only concern of gaining large scores without significant difficulty. Such games don't respect this game motto 'Triumph without peril brings no glory' and therefore will be removed from game server.


By clicking the green notch you accept the terms of use for the A.R.S.E.N.A.L Extended Power game level editor and you expressly accept that Tactical Soft may use freely levels you would eventually develop, if you refuse these terms click the red cross NOT to use the editor.


